Subject: [PATCH 075/107] Translations: drafting terms in the Japanese Drawing
 menu

New view, projection group, section view, detail view and balloon use
the words of Japanese drafting (three-view drawing, section drawing,
partial enlarged view, item number).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
